            "review_title": "Review at Bababa Japanese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Pasquale C\n1 contribution\n0\nGood food better service\nAug 2026 • Couples\nWhen I walk in and noticed it was a buffet and I was in two minds whether to stay but I did, we were so happy we did. The choice of food was amazing and tastes so good and for value for money it was fantastic. But what made the restaurant stand out way more than others was our waiter JACKSON. He was so helpful and always there ready to serve. Management should be proud of a waiter that made our experience wonderful.\nPas ( Australia)\nRead more\nWritten August 23, 2026",
