            "review_title": "Review at Bababa Japanese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Erico2709\nSingapore, Singapore2820 contributions\n0\nValue for money\nApr 2026 • Couples\nMost buffet you get pretty sloppy service or food but we were pleasantly impressed by both. They have different tiers of pricing with high prices giving you Wagyu beef & Sashimi. Our server was very helpful and constantly very attentive to ensure we are fed well and even helped us to BBQ for us. You can even swop to steamboat when you are done with the BBQ food.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 27, 2026",
