            "review_title": "Review at Bababa Japanese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Escape18160466067\n3 contributions\n0\nJul 2025 • Family\nThis neighbourhood Japanese restaurant has an ala carte and buffet menu. In my opinion, their portions are really generous. The sea grapes salad is something uncommon. Tempura has a light batter, and not greasy. A good portion of ebi for the price. Sushi rice a bit bland though, a bit lighthanded on the vinegar. Clean, and spacious interior.\nWritten July 18, 2025\nDreamer58492158313\nXin Chao Escape18160466067 from Bababa Japanese Restaurant Da Nang,\n\nThank you so much for taking the time to share your kind words with us. We’re truly delighted to hear that you enjoyed your experience at Bababa, from the flavors of our dishes to the service provided by our team.\n\nYour feedback means a great deal to us. We hope your visit to Da Nang was filled with wonderful experiences, and we would be honored to welcome you back to Bababa for another unforgettable meal shortly.\n\nWarmest regards,\nRead more\nWritten September 15, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
